            <title>[IGNITE-12365] Concurrent removeAll() on the same cache leads to deadlock</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12365</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;That&apos;s because removeAll is implemented as invokeAll with HashSet parameter.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;invokeAll + HashSet = &#128128;&lt;/p&gt;

